menu "devkit_net"

config DEVKIT_NET_WIFI
    bool "Built-in Wi-Fi"
    depends on SOC_WIFI_SUPPORTED
    default y
    help
        Registers the chip's own Wi-Fi as the station interface "sta".

config DEVKIT_NET_HTTP_DECOMPRESS
    bool "Decompress HTTP bodies"
    default y
    help
        The HTTP client asks for gzip and deflate bodies and decodes them.
        Off, it leaves out the decompressor and returns bodies as sent.

config DEVKIT_NET_HTTP2
    bool "HTTP/2"
    default y
    help
        The HTTP client offers h2 over TLS and speaks HTTP/2 to servers that
        take it. Off, it speaks HTTP/1.1 only.

config DEVKIT_NET_IRAM_OPT
    bool "Place the per-packet path in IRAM"
    default n
    help
        Runs the code every frame goes through from internal RAM instead of
        flash, at the cost of that much heap. Worth it where flash cache
        misses dominate, as on chips with a small instruction cache.

endmenu
